    "created_at": "2018-01-17T15:25:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-17T15:25:46Z",
    "body": "I get the same results in all browsers (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, and Safari) for:\r\n```\r\n<canvas></canvas>\r\n<script>\r\nctx = document.querySelector(\"canvas\").getContext(\"2d\")\r\nctx.moveTo(9.8255,71.1829);\r\nctx.lineTo(103,25);\r\nctx.lineTo(118,25);\r\nctx.moveTo(9.8255,71.1829);\r\nctx.closePath();\r\nctx.stroke();\r\n\r\n</script>\r\n```\r\nThe results seem to indicate a) unless I'm misunderstanding.",
